{"name":"Iron Keep","status":"ok","title":"Iron Keep","pageId":180353,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"dablink\" style=\"padding-left:2em;\"><i>This article is about the city. For the castle of the same name, see <a href=\"/wiki/Iron_Keep_(castle)\" title=\"Iron Keep (castle)\">Iron Keep (castle)</a>. For the kingdom of the same name, see <a href=\"/wiki/Oman\" title=\"Oman\">Oman</a>.</i></div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\">\n\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Iron Keep</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-pp149_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-pp149-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRA-p29_2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRA-p29-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-M.M_3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-M.M-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-D_4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-D-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Small city</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oman%27s_Isle\" title=\"Oman's Isle\">Oman's Isle</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Moonshae_Isles\" title=\"Moonshae Isles\">Moonshae Isles</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-pp149_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-pp149-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-M-p48_5-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-M-p48-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"races\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Races</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><small><b>Formerly:</b></small> <a href=\"/wiki/Northlander\" title=\"Northlander\">Northlander</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">humans</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-pp149_1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-pp149-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-M-p48_5-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-M-p48-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-D-11_6-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-D-11-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1479_DR\" title=\"1479 DR\">1479&#160;DR</a><br>5,730&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372&#160;DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler1\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruler</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thelgaar_Ironhand\" title=\"Thelgaar Ironhand\">Thelgaar Ironhand</a>&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1345_DR\" title=\"1345 DR\">1345&#160;DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Iron_Keep\" class=\"newcategory\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Iron Keep\">Inhabitants of  Iron Keep</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Locations_in_Iron_Keep\" class=\"newcategory\" title=\"Category:Locations in Iron Keep\">Locations in  Iron Keep</a></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Iron Keep</b> was a small city on <a href=\"/wiki/Oman%27s_Isle\" title=\"Oman's Isle\">Oman's Isle</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Moonshae_Isles\" title=\"Moonshae Isles\">Moonshae Isles</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-pp149_1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-pp149-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRA-p29_2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRA-p29-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-M.M_3-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-M.M-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-D_4-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-D-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> It was named for the <a href=\"/wiki/Iron_Keep_(castle)\" title=\"Iron Keep (castle)\">massive fortress</a> of the same name that stood above it,<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-pp149_1-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-pp149-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-M-p48_5-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-M-p48-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> and it served as the capital of the <a href=\"/wiki/Northlander\" title=\"Northlander\">Northlander</a> kingdom of <a href=\"/wiki/Oman\" title=\"Oman\">Oman</a> prior to that realm's collapse.<sup id=\"cite_ref-D-11_6-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-D-11-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> It lay abandoned and in ruins as of the late 15<sup>th</sup> century <a href=\"/wiki/DR\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DR\">DR</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-D-11_6-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-D-11-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-SCAG-p69_7-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SCAG-p69-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div class=\"frquote\">\n  <div class=\"quotesymbol\" style=\"line-height: 32px;\">“</div>\n  <div class=\"quotetext\">With this secure base to operate from, let us prepare our ships for trade. Are we not the greatest sailors in the world? Our vessels can carry goods from any realm known to man, to any other realm. And we shall profit handsomely. Let this be the road to our future!</div>\n  <div class=\"quotesymbol\" style=\"align-self: flex-end; line-height: 12px;\">”</div>\n</div><div class=\"quotesource\">—&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Thelgaar_Ironhand\" title=\"Thelgaar Ironhand\">Thelgaar Ironhand</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/1345_DR\" title=\"1345 DR\">1345 DR</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-DoM-ch5_8-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-DoM-ch5-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Description\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Description</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Geography\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Geography</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Government\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Government</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Defenses\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Defenses</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Trade\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trade</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Appearances\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appearances</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3\"><a href=\"#Novels_&_Short_Stories\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Novels &amp; Short Stories</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Connections\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Connections</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Description\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Iron_Keep?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Description\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The city largely comprised longhouses spread around the base of a rocky hill beside the waters of <a href=\"/wiki/Iron_Bay\" title=\"Iron Bay\">Iron Bay</a>, atop which sat the enormous and sprawling fortress of Iron Keep. Surrounding the town were fields and pastures.<sup id=\"cite_ref-M-p48_5-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-M-p48-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Geography\">Geography</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Geography\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Iron_Keep?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Geography\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The settlement lay on the eastern side of Iron Bay<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRA-p29_2-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRA-p29-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-M.M_3-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-M.M-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-D_4-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-D-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> where a large valley met the bleak shore.<sup id=\"cite_ref-DoM-ch5_8-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-DoM-ch5-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> It sat along a long beach which provided space for the stowage and construction of Oman's famous <a href=\"/wiki/Longship\" title=\"Longship\">longships</a>,<sup id=\"cite_ref-M-p49_9-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-M-p49-9\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>9<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> and the broad valley provided space to accommodate the camps of large armies.<sup id=\"cite_ref-DoM-ch5_8-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-DoM-ch5-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Government\">Government</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Government\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Iron_Keep?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Government\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The rulers of Oman were the most powerful of the Northlander kings as of the mid–14<sup>th</sup> century DR, overseeing lands across Oman's Isle and <a href=\"/wiki/Gwynneth\" title=\"Gwynneth\">Gwynneth</a> and personally involving themselves in the defense of the realms and the local shipbuilding traditions.<sup id=\"cite_ref-M-p48_5-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-M-p48-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-M-p49_9-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-M-p49-9\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>9<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Defenses\">Defenses</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Defenses\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Iron_Keep?veaction=edit&section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Defenses\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>At its height, the city was directly defended by a fleet of ten longships, each manned by 40 <a href=\"/wiki/Warrior\" title=\"Warrior\">warriors</a>. Additionally, the king could field a legion of 80 elite <a href=\"/wiki/Berserker\" title=\"Berserker\">berserkers</a> aboard two additional ships.<sup id=\"cite_ref-M-p50_10-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-M-p50-10\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>10<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trade\">Trade</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trade\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Iron_Keep?veaction=edit&section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trade\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Iron Keep was a major Northlander port for trade with the other realms of the Moonshaes and with far off <a href=\"/wiki/Waterdeep\" title=\"Waterdeep\">Waterdeep</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Ruathym\" title=\"Ruathym\">Ruathym</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-M-p12_11-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-M-p12-11\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>11<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>The city was known for its master <span class=\"new\" title=\"Shipwright (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU2hpcHdyaWdodD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">shipwrights</span>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-M-p48_5-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-M-p48-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> They specialized in building longships, and their process involved the contributions of <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemist\" title=\"Alchemist\">alchemists</a> to make <span class=\"new\" title=\"Sealant (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU2VhbGFudD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">sealant</span>, <a href=\"/wiki/Blacksmith\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Blacksmith\">blacksmiths</a> to make <a href=\"/wiki/Iron\" title=\"Iron\">iron</a> sockets and <a href=\"/wiki/Nail\" title=\"Nail\">nails</a>, <span class=\"new\" title=\"Ropemaker (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUm9wZW1ha2VyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">ropemakers</span> to twist <a href=\"/wiki/Rope\" title=\"Rope\">ropes</a>, and <span class=\"new\" title=\"Sewist (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU2V3aXN0P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">sewists</span> to make the sails.<sup id=\"cite_ref-M-p49_9-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-M-p49-9\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>9<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Iron_Keep?veaction=edit&section=6\" aria-label=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>Circa</i> the <a href=\"/wiki/1335_DR\" title=\"1335 DR\">Year of the Snow Winds, 1335 DR</a>, the city was visited by <a href=\"/wiki/Elminster\" title=\"Elminster\">Elminster</a> on his tour of the Moonshaes.<sup id=\"cite_ref-M-p49_9-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-M-p49-9\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>9<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-M-p35_12-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-M-p35-12\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>12<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>In <a href=\"/wiki/Tarsakh\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tarsakh\">Tarsakh</a> of the <a href=\"/wiki/1345_DR\" title=\"1345 DR\">Year of the Saddle, 1345 DR</a>, a council of Northlander kings met at Iron Keep and elected to launch a war against the <a href=\"/wiki/Ffolk\" title=\"Ffolk\">Ffolk</a> kingdom of <a href=\"/wiki/Corwell\" title=\"Corwell\">Corwell</a> in what would become known as the <a href=\"/wiki/Darkwalker_War\" title=\"Darkwalker War\">Darkwalker War</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRA-p30_13-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRA-p30-13\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>13<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRA-p42_14-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRA-p42-14\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>14<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> The <a href=\"/wiki/1346_DR\" title=\"1346 DR\">following year</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sahuagin\" title=\"Sahuagin\">sahuagin</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Undead\" title=\"Undead\">undead</a> from <a href=\"/wiki/Kressilacc\" title=\"Kressilacc\">Kressilacc</a> besieged Oman's Isle, driving many to flee to Iron Keep for security. On <a href=\"/wiki/Marpenoth_13\" title=\"Marpenoth 13\">Marpenoth 13</a> of that year, the forces of Kressilacc devastated Iron Keep and plundered it of its riches.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRA-p30_13-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRA-p30-13\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>13<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRA-p27_15-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRA-p27-15\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>15<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-D-ch12_16-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-D-ch12-16\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>16<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>The city had been rebuilt by the mid-to-late-14<sup>th</sup> century DR, by which time Oman had joined the <a href=\"/wiki/United_Moonshae_Isles\" title=\"United Moonshae Isles\">United Moonshae Isles</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-pp149_1-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-pp149-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p152_17-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p152-17\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>17<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> In the <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">Year of Wild Magic, 1372 DR</a>, it was said that Northlander raiders flying the colors of Iron Keep had begun to violate the peace of the unified kingdom, and it was hoped that this was a case of imposters trying to stoke tensions rather than a true return to violence by the Northlanders.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-pp149_1-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-pp149-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Iron Keep was razed and its people slaughtered by <a href=\"/wiki/Firbolg\" title=\"Firbolg\">firbolgs</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/Fomorian\" title=\"Fomorian\">fomorians</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Vor_Thomil\" title=\"Vor Thomil\">Vor Thomil</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/1374_DR\" title=\"1374 DR\">Year of Lightning Storms, 1374 DR</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p152_17-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p152-17\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>17<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-Drag362_18-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Drag362-18\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>18<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> It lay abandoned through the late 15<sup>th</sup> century DR, with its harbor filled with traps and its fortress inhabited by monsters.<sup id=\"cite_ref-D-11_6-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-D-11-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> During this time, a clan of Northlanders on <a href=\"/wiki/Norland\" title=\"Norland\">Norland</a> calling themselves <a href=\"/wiki/Oman_giantkiller\" title=\"Oman giantkiller\">Oman giantkillers</a> began developing fomorian-slaying tactics and recruiting allies to help them retake Iron Keep.<sup id=\"cite_ref-Drag370-p38_19-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Drag370-p38-19\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>19<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> \n</p><p>By the turn of the 16<sup>th</sup> century DR, the <a href=\"/wiki/Rusted\" title=\"Rusted\">rusted</a> pirate <span class=\"new\" title=\"Axenwright (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXhlbndyaWdodD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Axenwright</span> used the nearby fortress as a base from which to gather resources to build ships and weapons of war.<sup id=\"cite_ref-AiF-p177_20-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-AiF-p177-20\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>20<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inhabitants\">Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Iron_Keep?veaction=edit&section=7\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The Northlanders of Iron Keep were infamous for their violent and warlike attitudes, which made some of their allies worried that they could not be trusted in times of peace.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-pp149_1-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-pp149-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> They were also known to be gracious and generous hosts to their allies. Honored visitors could expect to be greeted by strong men to help secure their boat as well as dancing and screaming children and women.<sup id=\"cite_ref-M-p48_5-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-M-p48-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-M-p49_9-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-M-p49-9\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>9<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> Special occasions, such as the completion of a new longship, were celebrated with feasting and with <a href=\"/wiki/Keg\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Keg\">kegs</a> of dark <a href=\"/wiki/Ale\" title=\"Ale\">ale</a>, with revelry lasting until dawn.<sup id=\"cite_ref-M-p49_9-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-M-p49-9\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>9<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Iron_Keep?veaction=edit&section=8\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appearances\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Iron_Keep?veaction=edit&section=9\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appearances\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"block-indent\"><h4><span id=\"Novels_.26_Short_Stories\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Novels_&_Short_Stories\">Novels &amp; Short Stories</span></h4><div class=\"block-indent\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Darkwalker_on_Moonshae\" title=\"Darkwalker on Moonshae\">Darkwalker on Moonshae</a></i>&#160;• <i><a href=\"/wiki/Darkwell_(novel)\" title=\"Darkwell (novel)\">Darkwell</a></i></div></div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Iron_Keep?veaction=edit&section=10\" aria-label=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap mw-references-columns\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-FRCS3e-pp149-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-pp149_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-pp149_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-pp149_1-2\">1.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-pp149_1-3\">1.3</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-pp149_1-4\">1.4</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-pp149_1-5\">1.5</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-pp149_1-6\">1.6</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-pp149_1-7\">1.7</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sean_K._Reynolds\" title=\"Sean K. Reynolds\">Sean K. Reynolds</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Skip_Williams\" title=\"S