494-8</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-D-11-6\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-D-11_6-0\">6.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-D-11_6-1\">6.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-D-11_6-2\">6.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-D-11_6-3\">6.3</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shawn_Merwin\" title=\"Shawn Merwin\">Shawn Merwin</a>&#160;(November 2011). <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20151103180202/http://archive.wizards.com/dnd/Article.aspx?x=dnd/dun/201111backdrop\">“Backdrop: Moonshae Isles”</a>. In <a href=\"/wiki/Steve_Winter\" title=\"Steve Winter\">Steve Winter</a>&#160;ed. <a href=\"/wiki/Dungeon_magazine_196\" title=\"Dungeon magazine 196\"><i>Dungeon</i> #196</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>)&#160;(196)., p. 11. Archived from <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://archive.wizards.com/dnd/Article.aspx?x=dnd/dun/201111backdrop\">the original</a> on 2015-11-03.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-SCAG-p69-7\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-SCAG-p69_7-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Steve_Kenson\" title=\"Steve Kenson\">Steve Kenson</a>, <i>et al</i>.&#160;(November 2015). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Sword_Coast_Adventurer%27s_Guide\" title=\"Sword Coast Adventurer's Guide\">Sword Coast Adventurer's Guide</a></i>. Edited by <a href=\"/wiki/Kim_Mohan\" title=\"Kim Mohan\">Kim Mohan</a>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), p. 69. ISBN&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-0-7869-6580-9\" title=\"Special:BookSources/978-0-7869-6580-9\">978-0-7869-6580-9</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-DoM-ch5-8\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-DoM-ch5_8-0\">8.0</a><